          "content": "<h2>Description</h2><p>It is advisable to specidy order how rows should be ordered.</p><h2>Code examples</h2><h3>Non-compliant</h3><pre><code>SELECT name, surname from dbo.test order by name, surname asc;</code></pre><h3>Compliant</h3><pre><code>SELECT name, surname from dbo.test order by name desc, surname asc;</code></pre>"
