          "key": "default",
          "content": "<h2>Description</h2><p>COMMIT is missing after UPDATE/DELETE statement. If you run script without autocommit - your changes might be lost.</p><h2>Code examples</h2><h3>Non-compliant</h3><pre><code>SELECT 1; DELETE FROM temp1; SELECT 2;</code></pre><pre><code>COMMIT; DELETE FROM temp1;</code></pre><h3>Compliant</h3><pre><code>SELECT 1; DELETE FROM temp1; COMMIT; SELECT 2; </code></pre>"
        }
